## 4. Machine Learning & Data Science with SMILE

SMILE (Statistical Machine Intelligence and Learning Engine) provides state-of-the-art ML algorithms designed for high performance and clean API ergonomics:

### In-Memory DataFrames & Formulas
```java
// Read CSV, ARFF, Parquet, JSON, Arrow, Avro, or SQL tables
var iris = Read.arff(System.getProperty("smile.home") + "/data/weka/iris.arff");
System.out.println(iris.structure());

// Declarative modeling formula
var formula = Formula.lhs("class");
```

### Classification & Regression
```java
// Train Random Forest classifier
var model = RandomForest.fit(formula, iris);
System.out.println(model.metrics());

// Feature importance
for (var imp : model.importance()) {
    System.out.printf("%s: %.4f%n", imp.name(), imp.score());
}
```

### High-Performance Visualization
- **Swing Desktop Plots**: `ScatterPlot.of(...)`, `LinePlot.of(...)`, `BoxPlot.of(...)`, `Histogram.of(...)`. Call `show(plot.figure())` to open an interactive Swing plot window.
- **Vega-Lite Browser Plots**: `BarPlot`, `Heatmap`, `DensityPlot`, `BubblePlot`, `SplomPlot`. Automatically rendered in your default browser.

